{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/victoriametrics/vmagent","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:05:25.111Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/victoriametrics/vmagent/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/victoriametrics/vmagent"},"readme":"<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://victoriametrics.com/icons/apple-touch-icon.webp\" width=\"150\" alt=\"VictoriaMetrics logo\"/>\n</p>\n<h1 align=\"center\">VictoriaMetrics vmagent</h1>\n\n[![Join our SLACK Community](https://img.shields.io/badge/Join%20our%20SLACK%20Community-621773?style=for-the-badge&logo=slack&logoColor=white)](https://inviter.co/victoriametrics/)\n[![File a Bug on GitHub](https://img.shields.io/badge/File%20a%20Bug%20on%20GitHub-E94600?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics/issues)\n[![Source Code](https://img.shields.io/badge/Source%20Code-323232?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics/)\n</p>\n\n---\n[vmagent](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/vmagent/) is an agent for collecting metrics from various sources,\n[relabel and filter the collected metrics](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/vmagent/#relabeling)\nand store them in [VictoriaMetrics](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/)\nor any other storage systems via Prometheus `remote_write` protocol\nor via [VictoriaMetrics `remote_write` protocol](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/vmagent/#victoriametrics-remote-write-protocol).\n\n### Docker Pull Command\n\nWe recommend specifying the exact tag of the image:\n```\ndocker pull victoriametrics/vmagent:{TAG}\n```\nSee [Quick Start](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/vmagent/#quick-start) for details.\n\nSee examples of integrating with [VictoriaMetrics](https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics/tree/master/deployment/docker#docker-compose-environment-for-victoriametrics) for metrics collection.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"na